            <p class="P2">(16)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;On the south side of Beech Street, beginning immediately east of the driveway to 515 South Willard Street and extending east for 20 feet.</p>

            <p class="P2">(17)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Parking shall be restricted to one vehicle only on the west side of North Winooski Avenue in front of 207 North Winooski Avenue.</p>

