            <p class="P2">(576)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;On the west side of South Prospect Street, beginning at Prospect Parkway and extending south to the driveway for 789 South Prospect Street.</p>

            <p class="P2">(577)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;On the east side of South Prospect Street, beginning at Prospect Parkway and extending south to the driveway for 792 South Prospect Street.</p>

            <p class="P2">(578)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;On north side of Lakewood Parkway beginning at the driveway for 182 Lakewood Parkway and extending west for forty (40) feet. </p>

            <p class="P2">(579)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;On south side of Lakewood Parkway beginning at the driveway for 191 Lakewood Parkway and extending west for forty (40) feet.</p>

