            <p class="P2">(12)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;On the south side of Cherry Street beginning sixty (60) feet west of St. Paul Street and extending one hundred (100) feet west.</p>

            <p class="P2">(13)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;On the north side of Bank Street beginning one hundred forty (140) feet west of Saint Paul Street and extending west one hundred fifteen (115) feet.</p>

