      <h3 class="Cite" id="21"><a name="21">21</a> School crossing guards.</h3>
            <p class="P1">(a)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Motor vehicles shall be operated in conformance with directions given by adult school crossing guards, who are hereby given the authority to direct vehicular traffic at the following locations:</p>

            <p class="P2">(1)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Colchester Avenue and Mansfield Avenue.</p>

